CHAPTER.VERS:
Thus saith the Lord; Because of what 

          Gr. Idumea
         the Idumeans have done in taking vengeance on the house of Juda, and because they have remembered injuries, and have exacted full recompense;

Therefore thus saith the Lord, Because the Philistines have wrought revengefully, and raised up vengeance rejoicing from their heart to destroy the Israelites 

          Alex. for ever
         to a man;
